  {"p": ["Two things to know about Little Havana. First, the pastelitos and the cafecito are better and cheaper than anything on Ocean Drive, and you should eat standing at the window. Second, Calle Ocho is not a street you walk down for souvenirs; it is a street where you walk in to eat, and the restaurants that look least like restaurants from the outside are the ones worth the table."]},
